        "fields": {
          "milestone": "37",
          "statement": "The web UI helps the owner at a glance, on a phone first: it answers 'does anything need me?', shows what each run is doing in words, lays out the roadmap with short titles and progress for one project at a time, opens a readable page for every model node, lets the owner answer, approve and pause from it, and every screen matches its approved design on one spacing and type scale."
        },
