      {
        "fields": {
          "quote": "Overall it's just hard to digest the information that is being presented and doesn't help me much at all. We need to think it through a little more, screen by screen and get some new designs I think.",
          "statement": "The web UI is redesigned screen by screen, phone-first, around the question 'does anything need me?', with the orchestrator drafting each screen on a design canvas for the owner to approve before it is built; the clear roadmap bugs ship at once as bug requests."
        },
